.idea

# Secrets and local env (keep examples out of context noise via explicit ignores)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!infra/docker/.env.example

# Dependencies and build outputs
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.turbo

# Runtime / local data
data
uploads
*.pem
*.log

# Docs and non-runtime assets (Dockerfiles copy only what stages need)
docs
**/*.md
!packages/**/README.md

# Tests
**/*.test.ts
**/*.spec.ts
**/__tests__

# Misc
.DS_Store
*.swp
agent-transcripts
